<h2>The class of 1987</h2>
<p>The late eighties produced a cluster of collapses that all landed inside 8 years.</p>
<p><a href="/name/Jessica/">Jessica</a> peaked at 55992 in 1987 and halved in 8 years, to 27941.</p>
<p><a href="/name/Ashley/">Ashley</a> peaked at 54856 and halved in 8 years, to 26606. <a href="/name/Amanda/">Amanda</a> peaked at 41786 and halved in 6. <a href="/name/Brittany/">Brittany</a> peaked at 37792 and halved in 6. <a href="/name/Stephanie/">Stephanie</a> peaked at 24864 in 1990 and halved in 6 years, to 11643.</p>
